y canceled\",\"station.wait.overloaded\":\"the model to free up\",\"station.notice.rateLimit\":\"Out of quota; continues when it refills\",\"station.notice.modelLimit\":\"{model}'s limit is spent, not your quota; resumes on refill\",\"station.notice.limitShown\":\"{model} limit reached\",\"station.notice.limitShownAccount\":\"Account quota reached\",\"station.notice.reassignNone\":\"No other account can take it over; continues when the quota refills. To go on now, pick another model in the chat's settings, or add an account\",\"station.notice.reassignPinned\":\"This chat is kept to its account, so it was not moved; continues when the quota refills. To go on now, set its account to automatic or pick another in the chat's settings\",\"station.notice.refused\":\"The provider doesn't serve this station's region: set a proxy\",\"station.notice.runtimeMissing\":\"Couldn't start the agent: {name} isn't installed on this station\",\"station.notice.stopped\":\"Stopped the current task\",\"station.notice.cutOffRestart\":\"Station restarted and interrupted this turn; reply to continue\",\"station.port.mcp\":\"the agent MCP endpoint\",\"station.port.taken\":\"Port {host}:{port} for {what} is in use by another program (set in the config). Run `lsof -nP -iTCP:{port} -sTCP:LISTEN` to find it, or choose another port in the config.\",\"station.preview.badAddress\":\"Bad address: {error}\",\"station.preview.badMethod\":\"Unknown request method {method}\",\"station.preview.noAnswer\":\"localhost:{port} on this machine isn't responding\",\"station.preview.noAnswerSaying\":\"localhost:{port} on this machine isn't responding: {error}\",\"station.preview.socketRefused\":\"localhost:{port} rejected this WebSocket ({status})\",\"station.profile.addressNeeded\":\"Enter a valid endpoint URL (starting with http or https)\",\"station.profile.cannotRun\":\"“{profile}” can't run {runtime}\",\"station.profile.disabled\":\"“{profile}” is disabled; enable it first\",\"station.profile.chatgptSubscrip