paces {workspaces} here, and that station's home workspace is not one of them, so it would serve chats it never served. Move it to a station whose home workspace it serves, or let it serve that workspace here first\",\"station.share.moving\":\"This account is being moved already; wait a moment and look again\",\"station.share.moveNotTaken\":\"The other station did not take the account; it stays here. Try again once that station is up to date\",\"station.share.skillName\":\"This name can't be a folder name on every station: it can't start with a dot, end with a dot or a space, or contain / \\\\ : * ? \\\" < > |\",\"station.core.driveOldStation\":\"This station is too old for Files; update it first\",\"station.drive.invalid_request\":\"Invalid request\",\"station.drive.not_a_root\":\"That folder isn't one of the pinned folders\",\"station.drive.not_found\":\"No such file or folder\",\"station.drive.path_escape\":\"Paths can't leave a pinned folder\",\"station.drive.protected\":\"The station's own data can't be opened\",\"station.drive.permission\":\"The station isn't allowed to do that\",\"station.presets.clone.invalid\":\"Not a Git address that can be cloned\",\"station.presets.clone.readOnly\":\"A read-only member can't clone repositories onto this station\",\"station.presets.modelBound\":\"The preset “{preset}” runs {model}, and its chats open only with it; to use another model, edit the preset or pick “No preset”\",\"station.presets.stationBound\":\"The preset “{preset}” does not open chats on this station; switch to a station it names, or edit the preset or pick “No preset”\",\"station.drive.manage\":\"Read-only members can't pin folders\",\"station.drive.is_a_directory\":\"That is a folder\",\"station.drive.not_a_directory\":\"That isn't a folder\",\"station.drive.exists\":\"There's already one with that name\",\"station.drive.upload_lost\":\"The upload was interrupted and has to start over\",\"station.drive.too_large\":\"The station's disk is full\",\"station.drive.tooBigToSend\":\"Too big to send (1 GB at most)\",\"station.drive.io\":\"Read or write error\",\"station.drive.helperAsking\":\"This Mac hasn't let still.fail Helper open “{folder}” yet. A window is up on that Mac: click Allow there and it opens.\",\"station.drive.helperClosed\":\"This Mac hasn't let still.fail Helper open “{folder}” yet. The window asking for it on that Mac was just closed; open this folder again in a few minutes and it comes up again.\",\"station.drive.helperNeeded\":\"This Mac hasn't let still.fail Helper open “{folder}” yet. On that Mac, allow it in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Files and Folders.\",\"station.permissions.unknown\":\"This permission can't be requested on this station\",\"station.permissions.noHelper\":\"still.fail Helper isn't responding; try again later\",\"station.permissions.none\":\"Couldn't show the permission window on that Mac\",\"station.permissions.noDisk\":\"No external disk is connected to that Mac; connect one, then request again\",\"station.permissions.noNetworkDisk\":\"No network disk is mounted on that Mac; mount one, then request again\",\"station.drive.place.home\":\"Home\",\"station.drive.place.Desktop\":\"Desktop\",\"station.drive.place.Documents\":\"Documents\",\"station.drive.place.Downloads\":\"Downloads\",\"station.drive.place.Movies\":\"Movies\",\"station.drive.place.Videos\":\"Videos\",\"station.drive.place.Music\":\"Music\",\"station.drive.place.Pictures\":\"Pictures\",\"station.drive.no_trash\":\"No trash here; it can only be deleted permanently\",\"station.machineLogin.cannotRun\":\"Can't run the login command: {error}\",\"station.machineLogin.timedOut\":\"Login not finished in 15 min; ended\",\"station.machineLogin.stalled\":\"The login command did nothing for {minutes} min with nothing left for anyone to do (stuck on a keychain or credential store?); ended. Its last screen:\",\"station.machineLogin.exited\":\"The login command exited ({code})\",\"station.machineLogin.badCommand\":\"Give a login command, the tool's own, e.g. gh auth login\",\"station.machineLogin.unknown\":\"No such login (it may have ended a while ago)\",\"station.machineLogin.ended\":\"This login has ended\",\"station.machineLogin.notAgain\":\"Only a login that did not finish (it failed or ran out of time) can be started again\",\"station.loginPage.noBrowser\":\"There's no Chrome on this station, so the page can't open in its browser\",\"station.loginPage.nothing\":\"This login has no page to open in a browser now\",\"station.loginPage.failed\":\"Couldn't open it in the station's browser: {error}\",\"station.login.consoleFailed\":\"Couldn't sign in to OpenCode: {error}\",\"station.login.consoleExpired\":\"The code has expired; sign in again\",\"station.login.consoleDenied\":\"Authorization was denied\",\"station.login.consoleUnreadable\":\"Signed in, but the OpenCode sign-in couldn't be read\",\"station.profile.consoleSignedOut\":\"OpenCode sign-in expired\",\"station.login.kimiFailed\":\"Couldn't sign in to Kimi: {error}\",\"station.login.kimiExpired\":\"The code has expired; sign in again\",\"station.login.kimiDenied\":\"Authorization was denied\",\"station.login.kimiUnreadable\":\"Signed in, but the Kimi sign-in couldn't be read\",\"station.profile.kimiSignedOut\":\"Kimi sign-in expired\",\"station.login.cursorKeyFailed\":\"Signed in to Cursor, but couldn't create the station's key: {error}\",\"station.profile.cursorSubscription\":\"Cursor account\",\"station.profile.cursorKeyRevoked\":\"The station's Cursor key was revoked; sign in again\",\"station.quota.cursorUnsupported\":\"Cursor doesn't report plan usage to the station\",\"station.profile.devinSubscription\":\"Devin account\",\"station.profile.agySubscription\":\"Google account (Antigravity CLI)\",\"station.profile.agyEnterpriseSubscription\":\"Gemini Enterprise (Antigravity CLI)\",\"station.quota.devinUnsupported\":\"Devin doesn't report plan usage to the station; see Usage on app.devin.ai\",\"station.quota.agyUnsupported\":\"Antigravity CLI doesn't report plan usage to the station\",\"station.quota.agyPayAsYouGo\":\"This company account pays as it goes, with no fixed allowance\",\"station.quota.agyNoWindows\":\"Antigravity CLI didn't return quota windows\",\"station.quota.agyVerify\":\"Google needs this account verified before it can use Antigravity: sign in to accounts.google.com with this Google account, follow the prompts to verify it, then check the quota again\",\"station.quota.agyVerifyAt\":\"Google needs this account verified before it can use Antigravity. Open the link below in a browser signed in to this Google account, verify it, then check the quota again\\n{url}\",\"station.updates.devinElsewhere\":\"Installed at {path}, not by Devin's installer; update it manually on that machine\",\"station.login.devinNoTerminal\":\"Devin's sign-in needs a terminal, which this machine can't provide; sign in on another station\",\"station.login.agyNoTerminal\":\"Antigravity CLI's sign-in needs a terminal, which this machine can't provide; sign in on another station\",\"station.login.agyCodeRefused\":\"The sign-in didn't finish with that code; start signing in again and paste the new code\",\"station.login.agyFailed\":\"Google couldn't finish signing in: {error}. Start signing in again; if it still fails, check that the Google Cloud project can be used\",\"station.context.busy\":\"A task is running; stop it and try again\",\"station.context.held\":\"This station can't run agents right now\",\"station.context.managersOnly\":\"Only workspace admins can change this setting\",\"station.elevation.managersOnly\":\"Only workspace admins can change this setting\",\"station.elevation.busy\":\"The last change hasn't finished yet; try again shortly\",\"station.elevation.notAdmin\":\"The Windows account running this station isn't an administrator, so it can't run as administrator\",\"station.elevation.notInstalled\":\"This station wasn't installed with the installer, so this can't be changed from here\",\"station.screenService.managersOnly\":\"Only workspace admins can change this setting\",\"station.screenService.busy\":\"The last change hasn't finished yet; try again shortly\",\"station.screenService.notAdmin\":\"The Windows account running this station isn't an administrator, so it can't install the system service\",\"station.screenService.notAvailable\":\"This station build doesn't include the screen service component, so this can't be changed from here\",\"station.context.empty\":\"No context yet\",\"station.context.cannotCompact\":\"{name} can't compact its context\",\"station.notice.compacted\":\"Context compacted\",\"station.notice.runAccountChanged\":\"Switched account: {was} → {now}\",\"station.notice.runChanged\":\"Switched: {was} → {now}\",\"station.notice.runDefaultModel\":\"default model\",\"station.notice.runDefaultEffort\":\"default effort\",\"station.notice.runStandard\":\"Standard\",\"station.notice.compactFailed\":\"Couldn't compact the context: {why}\",\"station.notice.afresh\":\"Context started afresh; the next message reads back what it needs first\",\"station.notice.afreshCold\":\"The cache had expired, so the context started afresh; reading back what it needs first\",\"station.notice.afreshRefused\":\"Codex still refused the conversation (Bad Request), so the context started afresh; reading back what it needs first\",\"station.notice.cleared\":\"Context cleared; the next message starts a new conversation\",\"station.relay.opening\":\"{who} relayed the still.fail chat {chat} here; it goes on in this thread.\",\"station.relay.relayed\":\"{who} relayed this chat to {place}\",\"station.relay.pick\":\"Pick the connect and channel to relay to\",\"station.relay.threadIn\":\"a thread in {place}\",\"station.cc.said\":\"{who} said on still.fail:\",\"station.cc.failed\":\"Could not copy this to {place}: {error}\",\"station.updates.hermesExternal\":\"Install Hermes 0.21.7 or newer with its ACP and MCP extras and configure its provider on this machine; manage updates with Hermes.\",\"station.profile.hermesModelsEmpty\":\"Hermes returned no available models. Check this Profile’s provider settings, or add a model by name.\",\"station.profile.hermesModelsFailed\":\"Couldn’t read Hermes models: {error}. Check this Profile’s provider settings and try again, or add a model by name.\",\"station.profile.hermesModelsLimited\":\"Showing {n} available models, up to {limit}; add other models by name\",\"station.admin.updateClientForRuntime\":\"Update the app to view this agent’s execution history\",\"station.admin.updateApp\":\"This app is too old for this station. Update the app.\",\"station.card.asking\":\"✍️ Your answer needed\",\"station.slack.replyHint\":\"Reply in this thread to answer\",\"station.slack.loginOpen\":\"Sign in at {domain}\",\"station.slack.loginDeviceCode\":\"Enter this code on the sign-in page:\",\"station.slack.loginCode\":\"The code the login page gives\",\"station.slack.loginCodeHint\":\"Paste it here, not in the thread\",\"station.slack.loginSubmit\":\"Submit\",\"station.slack.loginEntered\":\"{name} entered the code; it is being checked\",\"station.slack.loginRefused\":\"The login did not take it: {error}\",\"station.slack.newChatTitle\":\"New chat\",\"station.slack.newChatSubmit\":\"Start\",\"station.slack.newChatCancel\":\"Cancel\",\"station.slack.newChatModel\":\"Model\",\"station.slack.newChatModelHint\":\"Type to search all models\",\"station.slack.newChatDefaultModel\":\"default model\",\"station.slack.newChatWords\":\"Message\",\"station.slack.newChatWordsHint\":\"Posted in this channel as the first message of a new thread\",\"station.slack.newChatEmpty\":\"Write a message first\",\"station.slack.newChatNoModel\":\"No profile runs this model now; pick another\",\"station.slack.newChatBy\":\"{who} started this chat with {model}\",\"station.slack.newChatNotHere\":\"The bot is not in this channel; add it first: {error}\",\"station.slack.newChatFailed\":\"Couldn't post in the channel: {error}\",\"station.feishu.replyHint\":\"Reply in the chat to answer\",\"station.notice.network\":\"Connection lost; reply to retry\",\"station.notice.context\":\"Over the context limit; compact, then retry\",\"station.notice.model\":\"The model failed; reply to retry\",\"station.notice.modelWhy\":\"The model failed: {why}\",\"station.notice.cannotStartWhy\":\"Couldn't start the agent: {why}\",\"station.failure.auth\":\"Account authentication failed\",\"station.failure.refused\":\"The provider doesn't serve this region\",\"station.failure.rateLimit\":\"Hit a usage or rate limit\",\"station.failure.overloaded\":\"The model is busy\",\"station.failure.network\":\"Lost the connection to the model provider\",\"station.failure.context\":\"The conversation exceeds the model's context limit\",\"station.failure.model\":\"The model failed\",\"station.failure.exited\":\"The agent process exited unexpectedly\",\"station.failure.other\":\"Unknown error\",\"station.context.tooShort\":\"there isn't enough in the conversation yet\",\"station.share.notLent\":\"The station this subscription is signed in on couldn't lend it; it may be offline\",\"station.share.stationsUnknown\":\"This station hasn't heard yet which stations its workspaces have; try again in a moment\",\"station.claudeAuth.machineRunsOut\":\"This station's Claude sign-in is about to expire; sign in again\",\"station.dsh.noTools\":\"DeepSeek Harness couldn't reach this station's tools; send another message to try again\",\"station.notice.denied\":\"The provider refused the request (403) without saying why\",\"station.failure.denied\":\"The provider refused the request\",\"station.notice.blocked\":\"The provider's firewall blocked this station's network; retry from another one\",\"station.failure.blocked\":\"Blocked by the provider's firewall\",\"station.profile.agyFailed\":\"Couldn’t start the Antigravity CLI: {error}\",\"station.move.card.title\":\"Move everything of this station to “{to}” ({n} items), one item after another: each chat pauses for seconds as it goes, and can be moved back.\",\"station.move.card.confirm\":\"Move everything\",\"station.move.card.confirmDetail\":\"Each chat, its jobs, accounts and connects go to that station in turn; one that cannot move is said\",\"station.move.card.decline\":\"Not now\",\"station.move.card.declineDetail\":\"Nothing is moved\",\"station.move.ownersOnly\":\"Only an owner or admin of the workspace confirms moving a whole station.\",\"station.move.askGone\":\"This card no longer asks anything: ask the agent again.\",\"station.move.movedThere\":\"This chat moved to another station: open it there.\",\"station.move.off\":\"Moving chats between stations is not open on this station yet: nothing was moved.\",\"station.move.offThere\":\"Moving chats between stations is not open on station “{station}” yet: nothing was moved.\",\"station.move.unreachable\":\"Station “{station}” cannot be reached now: nothing was moved. Try again once it is up.\",\"station.move.module.vault\":\"secrets\",\"station.move.module.connects\":\"connect\",\"station.move.module.jobs\":\"job\",\"station.move.module.settings\":\"setting\",\"station.move.module.repos\":\"repository\",\"station.move.module.chats\":\"chat\",\"station.move.module.accounts\":\"account\",\"station.move.called\":\"{what} “{label}”\",\"station.move.sched.cycle\":\"these items need each other, so none can go first: {chain}\",\"station.move.sched.noItem\":\"no {item} here to move (station_move plan lists them)\",\"station.move.sched.nothing\":\"nothing to move\",\"station.move.sched.notThere\":\"{item} is not there to move back\",\"station.move.sched.nothingThere\":\"nothing there to move back\",\"station.move.sched.more\":\" and {n} more\",\"station.move.sched.wouldStop\":\"it needs {need}, whose move would stop {some} here: move it on its own (its row says what it stops), or make it one that can be shared first\",\"station.move.sched.wouldStopIt\":\"moving it would stop {some} here, which need it: move it on its own (its row says what it stops), or make it one that can be shared first\",\"station.move.sched.waitsFailed\":\"it waits for {need}, which did not move: {why}\",\"station.move.sched.needsFirst\":\"it needs {need} there first: move that first, or move it together with what it needs (or let it go ahead and wait there for it)\",\"station.move.sched.notBroughtBack\":\"{what} moved for {for}, which did not go, and could not be brought back: {why}\",\"station.move.sched.backNeedsFailed\":\"{item} there needs it, and it did not come back: {why}\",\"station.move.sched.backNeeds\":\"{item} there needs it: move that back first, or move all back\",\"station.move.sched.needCannot\":\"it needs {need} there, which cannot go: {why}\",\"station.move.sched.orArrive\":\" (or let it go ahead and wait there for it)\",\"station.move.sched.unanswered\":\"the other station did not answer whether it has it: ask again\",\"station.move.sched.machineLogin\":\"this machine's own login cannot go to another station: sign in there with the login tool\",\"station.move.sched.settingThere\":\"that station has its own {key} ({value}), which it keeps: its chats rely on it. Change it in that station's settings if this one's is meant there\",\"station.move.sched.settingHere\":\"this station has its own {key}, which it keeps: its chats rely on it. Change it in this station's settings if the other's is meant here\",\"station.move.why.cannotRead\":\"this station cannot read {count} of its files ({path}): give it access, or move them out of the chat's folder, then move it again\",\"station.move.why.noSpace\":\"no room left on the disk: free some and move it again\",\"station.move.why.carryFailed\":\"could not carry its files (this station's log says why): move it again\",\"station.move.why.carryUnanswered\":\"the other station did not answer while its files were being sent: move it again once it answers\",\"station.move.why.failedHere\":\"it could not be done (this station's log says why): try again\",\"station.move.why.unanswered\":\"the other station did not answer: try again once it answers\",\"station.move.why.cloneLogin\":\"{station} could not clone {url}: it is not signed in to {host}. Sign in to {host} on {station} (its git credentials or an SSH key there), then move it again\",\"station.move.why.cloneLate\":\"the clone of {url} on {station} did not end in {minutes} min: move it again\",\"station.move.why.abandoned\":\"The move was asked to stop before this chat went: it goes on here\",\"station.move.why.noSuchChat\":\"There is no such chat here\",\"station.move.why.notInWorkspaceNow\":\"That chat is not of a workspace this station is in now (handed over already, or not shown here yet)\",\"station.move.why.nameAnother\":\"Name another station of the chat's workspace\",\"station.move.why.notOfWorkspace\":\"That station is not one of this chat's workspace's: name one station_list lists\",\"station.move.why.tasksOnly\":\"{station} only runs tasks: a chat goes only to a whole station\",\"station.move.why.goingAlready\":\"That chat is going to {station} already: wait for it to be there\",\"station.move.why.handingAlready\":\"That chat is being handed over already: wait for it, or look at station_move status\",\"station.move.why.connectFirst\":\"chat “{chat}” is of connect “{connect}” ({kind}), whose chats run only where it runs: move the connect first (or move it together with what it needs)\",\"station.move.why.oneSession\":\"one session for all its messages\",\"station.move.why.filesOutside\":\"chat “{chat}” works in {dir}, which is not this station's own: its files would not go; ask again with its files left behind if that is meant\",\"station.move.why.inTurn\":\"chat “{chat}” is in a turn now: ask again when it ended, or with wait, which waits for it\",\"station.move.why.turnLate\":\"chat “{chat}” was still in its turn after {minutes} min: ask again later\",\"station.move.why.noGit\":\"{station} has no git, and this chat has {n} git worktree(s) to be made again there: install git there first\",\"station.move.why.allNoRoom\":\"Moving all {n} chats would add about {adds} to {station}, which has {free} free: that would leave less than the {floor} kept free there. Free about {short} there and move all again, or move chats one at a time (each goes only where it fits).\",\"station.move.why.fullThere\":\"{station} ran out of room as this chat's files arrived ({error}; {free} free there now): nothing of it was kept there and it goes on here; free some room there and move it again, or pick another station\",\"station.move.why.noRoom\":\"{station} has {free} free and this chat needs {need}, which would leave less than the {floor} kept free there: free some room there, or pick another station\",\"station.move.why.stopping\":\"This station is stopping\",\"station.move.why.filesMissing\":\"{n} of its files are not there after they were sent\",\"station.move.why.notWhatSent\":\"What it has is not what was sent ({what})\",\"station.move.why.countSessions\":\"{sent} sessions sent, {there} there\",\"station.move.why.countThread\":\"{sent} {what} of a thread sent, {there} there\",\"station.move.why.countRows\":\"{sent} rows of {table} sent, {there} there\",\"station.move.why.notStationOfWs\":\"Not a station of this workspace\",\"station.move.why.badRequest\":\"A request between the two stations was wrong: {detail}\",\"station.move.why.droppedThere\":\"That hand-over was dropped there: hand the chat over again\",\"station.move.why.shownAlready\":\"It is shown there already\",\"station.move.why.wasAlready\":\"That hand-over was {step} there already\",\"station.move.why.accountsMissing\":\"The account(s) {names} are not usable on this station: move or share them here first (station_move, module accounts)\",\"station.move.why.shownHere\":\"It is shown here: it went\",\"station.move.why.liveThere\":\"a chat of this key is live on {station}: it went on there apart from this one, and the two are not merged; this one stays here, and each goes on where it is: say in either what the other has that it needs\",\"station.move.chatStayed\":\"The chat did not go to {station} and goes on here: {why}\",\"station.move.noAnswer\":\"{station} did not answer this step: its connection was gone; the next step dials it anew.\",\"station.move.gone\":\"{station} does not answer: nothing more is asked of it in this move. Move again once it is up.\",\"station.move.onItsWay\":\"This chat is on its way here from {station}, which does not answer: once it is up, the chat is shown here, or, if it took the hand-over back, stays there.\",\"station.move.previousStill\":\"This station is still switching to its new process: moving cannot begin yet. Ask again in a moment.\",\"station.move.leavesLogins\":\"This machine's own login {names}, which it ran on before, cannot go: the chat goes on the login it runs on now, and what it ran on that login stays on this station.\",\"station.move.restartedMidway\":\"This station started again as the chat was being handed over to {station}: it goes on here, nothing of it went. Hand it over again (station_move, or the move page) when you want it there.\",\"station.move.stoppedMidway\":\"This station stopped as the chat was being handed over to {station}: it goes on here, nothing of it went. Hand it over again once this station is up.\",\"station.move.stoppedHeld\":\"This station stopped as the chat was being handed over to {station}: it goes on here once this station is up again, nothing of it went; then hand it over again.\",\"station.move.stoppedChat\":\"This chat is stopped on 「{here}」: it waits for 「{item}」, which is on 「{there}」. To go on, bring 「{item}」 back here, or move this chat to 「{there}」 (station_move, or the move page). What you said is kept and handed to its agent when it goes on.\",\"station.move.stoppedChatHere\":\"This chat is stopped on 「{here}」: it waits for 「{item}」, which was moved away. To go on, bring 「{item}」 back here, or move this chat to where it is (station_move, or the move page). What you said is kept and handed to its agent when it goes on.\",\"station.move.managersOnly\":\"Only an owner or admin of the workspace moves this station's chats and items.\",\"station.move.running\":\"Another move is under way on this station: wait for it to end (the move page shows how far it is), then try again.\",\"station.move.isRig\":\"This station only runs tasks and has no chats to move: make it a whole station first.\",\"station.move.notWhole\":\"“{station}” only runs tasks: pick a whole station of the workspace.\",\"station.move.noStation\":\"There is no station “{station}” in this workspace: pick one of the workspace's stations.\",\"station.move.self\":\"That is this station: pick another one.\",\"station.move.pick\":\"Say what to move: a module and one of its items, or everything.\",\"station.move.notRunning\":\"No move is under way on this station: there is nothing to stop.\",\"station.move.restarted\":\"This station restarted during the move: what had moved stays moved, the rest is here as it was. Ask again to go on.\",\"station.group.answerOptions\":\"Reply with a number or an option's words to answer.\",\"station.group.answerText\":\"Reply to answer.\",\"station.group.secretReceived\":\"{name} handed you the secret \\\"{label}\\\" end to end: its value is the attached file alone (it is in no message and in no log). Use it from there; never repeat it in the chat.\",\"station.group.badServer\":\"The server ID is the server's 64-character hex ID\",\"station.group.noRelay\":\"Give at least one relay address\",\"station.group.badRelay\":\"A relay address starts with https:// or http://\",\"station.group.noCode\":\"Give a join code (an invitation or a device code, 16 characters)\",\"station.group.badCode\":\"A join code is 16 letters and digits, like XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX\",\"station.group.longName\":\"A member's name is {most} characters at most\",\"station.speed.invalid\":\"Choose Standard, Fast or Ultrafast on a runtime that supports speed settings.\",\"station.speed.ultrafast_unavailable\":\"To use Ultrafast, choose a supported Codex model and an eligible ChatGPT subscription, or choose Standard or Fast.\"}"
